id: pm-gh1478
title: "GH-1478: Read-output compaction splits valid emoji at 240 code units, crashing TOON and emitting lone surrogates in JSON"
description: "GitHub report https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/1478. Bounded output compaction preserves valid Unicode prefixes in JSON and TOON through a shared primitive, without changing budget accounting or unbounded output."
